      "message": "The changes in `driver/fingerprint/egis/egis_api.h` are nearly identical to `zephyr/drivers/fingerprint/fingerprint_egis630_private.h`.\n\nIssue: Maintaining two identical headers for the same API increases the likelihood of them diverging during future maintenance.\n\nRecommendation: If possible, have the Zephyr driver include the central Egis header rather than duplicating the entire API definition and comments.",
